title: Dashboard › Requests table › Read a row: bars, clock and what happens next
route: /dashboard
intro: What each cell of a row means. The bars and the clock follow different rules for a normal request and for a denial (an ID that starts with D-). Nothing in these cells is a button except the case ID and Open. Case, Payer, Where it is, Clock and At stake can be sorted from their headings.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A row in the Requests table"
screen c1 "Case\nUnderlined ID, e.g. 'R-1042', and the request type, e.g. 'Admission'"
screen c2 "Payer\nShort name: 'Summit Medicaid', 'Cardinal', 'Beacon PPO', 'Harborview MA', 'Lakeshore', 'Evergreen'\nProgram under it: 'Residential 3.5', 'IOP', 'PHP', 'Detox'"

decision d1 "Is it a denial? (ID starts with D-)"
screen w1 "Where it is\nChip such as 'Info requested' and four bars\n'Prepared, Received, In review, Decided'"
screen w2 "Where it is\nChip such as 'Call booked' and four bars\n'Call, Appeal 1, Appeal 2, External'"
process w3 "Bars: done are green, the current one is dark green (ochre when the chip is amber), later ones are grey\nHover shows 'Progress: Prepared, Received, In review, Decided. Now at In review.' or 'Route: Call, Appeal 1, Appeal 2, External. Now at Call.'"

group gClock "Clock column"
  decision k1 "Does the row carry a fixed note?"
  screen k2 "Note, e.g. 'decision 11/02'\nUnder it 'filed 10/05'"
  decision k3 "Is there a deadline (an open denial)?"
  decision k4 "How much time is left?"
  screen k5 "'window closed'"
  screen k6 "'36 h left' in red\nUnder 2 days; under it e.g. 'peer-to-peer window'"
  screen k7 "'3 days left' in ochre\nUnder 7 days; under it 'to resubmit' or 'to file'"
  screen k8 "'12 days left' in plain text"
  decision k9 "Is the stage Decided? (an approval)"
  screen k10 "'today'\nUnder it 'approved 1 h 30 m ago'"
  decision k11 "How long in this stage compared with typical?"
  screen k12 "'1 d 14 h' and 'typical 1 d'\nOver 1.5 × typical adds ochre 'late'"
  screen k13 "'4 d 12 h' and 'typical 2 d'\nOver 2 × typical adds red 'very late'"
  screen k14 "'1 h 12 m' and 'typical 2 h'\nWithin typical, plain text"
endgroup

screen a1 "At stake\nMoney asked for, e.g. '$22.4K'"
screen n1 "What happens next\nAgent badge and a line, e.g. 'Needs your input. Scribe has a question' or 'Navigator checks again in 5 minutes'\nAn approval says 'Write-back is off in EMR Connect' instead of 'Write-back waits for you' while write-back is off"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Order, rows and paging"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Header › Check all now and the demo clock"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Sort the rows"

s1 --> c1 --> c2 --> d1
d1 -->|No| w1 --> w3
d1 -->|Yes| w2 --> w3
w3 --> k1
k1 -->|Yes| k2 --> a1
k1 -->|No| k3
k3 -->|Yes| k4
k4 -->|Zero or less| k5 --> a1
k4 -->|Under 2 days| k6 --> a1
k4 -->|2 to 7 days| k7 --> a1
k4 -->|7 days or more| k8 --> a1
k3 -->|No| k9
k9 -->|Yes| k10 --> a1
k9 -->|No| k11
k11 -->|Over 1.5 times| k12 --> a1
k11 -->|Over 2 times| k13 --> a1
k11 -->|Within typical| k14 --> a1
a1 --> n1 --> g1
k11 -.-> g2
s1 -.-> g3
